> @stevo: Sorry I don't understand the "make it the same as it was before".
> From my point of view:
>
>    - Establishing language rules "forever" is not possible. Therefore
>    some changes will be necessary. This is what called "evolution".
>    - Forking may be interesting. It may be an pure experiment, a "feature
>    branch", a fix, etc.
>    - Reintegrating a branch to the core actually changes the core! This
>    is why it must be done *very carefully*, in order to not break initial
>    intents of the language.
>
